        "id": 1569742
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T13:34:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not really no, sadly, due to these pages being part of the pKVM carveout. They could probably be allocated separately, but given this is really just a debug option I didn\u0027t think it was worth the extra complexity. This teardown_selftest_vm() isn\u0027t really necessary, so I could also just drop it.\n\nNote that I tried \u0027stealing\u0027 pages from the host stage-2 pool to top-up the selftest_vm pool, but that has its own set of problems which leads to something rather fragile.",
      "parentUuid": "0d615199_a4a17cc5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2426,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 2426,
        "endChar": 19
