      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T13:34:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, perhaps the simplest way is to just have a hardcoded IPA rather than make it an offest from phys. I guess something like BIT(pgt-\u003eia_bits - 1) or something?",
      "parentUuid": "9e262a88_367a00bb",
      "range": {
